[quote="MarioFanaticXV"]

Seems kind of silly to run the preorders for only one month... But I really want to get those promo cards, so I plan to order before the game releases. I&#39;ve been really looking forward to this, but I just now found out they did this pre-pre-order run (why? Why not just wait until you&#39;re ready to take preorders in full?).

[/quote]

&nbsp;

Don&#39;t think there will be any other pre-orders. Since there wasn&#39;t a Kickstarter, GtG ran this pre-order as a special opportunity for the same length of time as a Kickstarter. They have to put a limit on the time of this special pre-order because they need to know how many of the promo cards to print. If you missed the opportunity to get these promo cards, you&#39;ll have an opportunity to get them at some upcoming conventions, you will probably be able to print them yourself eventually, and you will be able to get them as part of a collection of all promo cards that will be made available at some point after all of the Sentinels expansions are released in the next few years.

&nbsp;

Are &nbsp;any of those other options as ideal as being able to get the promos now? No, probably not, but there it is.

&nbsp;
